and no new def is introduced (which would move the mirror-coverage ratchet)". It uses
the SAME iterative stack walk for the same reason. `_run_pipeline` is already on both
ratchets' lists, so neither moves.
AFTER THE MOVE: all 22 fast planes green, witnesses 1697 (refused) / 1698 (verifies).
